# MF Overhaul 0.4.1: user screenshot: burst smoke "is spherical instead of fluid". Each puff was one big (3-6 m at birth), slowly
#   animated (c22 1.2-1.5, vanilla 5) sprite with little overlap, so it read as a ball. The smoke / dust textures are animated
#   flipbooks: the animation rate is what makes them boil. Now: animation back to 4.5 (bomb 3.5, dust 3), puffs born small and
#   growing (smoke 1.5/2.5/3 -> 18/28/38 m, dust 2/3/3 -> 20/30/30 m), more of them at lower opacity so they merge (smoke 8/10/14 ->
#   14/16/22 at alpha 0xB0, dust 8/10/10 -> 12/16/14 at alpha 0xB0), a little more sideways drift (0.2 / 0.22) so the mass spreads.
#   Lifetimes, fade points, colours and vertical motion as 0.4.0.
